extends RefCounted
## Five more long tasks for regions that lacked one (docs/STORY.md "the regions' long tasks"): the Lanternwood, the Thousand Cairns, the
## Southwood and the Hollow King, the White Pans and the Salt Ship, the Long Arches. Each is eight steps in the task verbs (clues, tracks,
## lantern_walk, vigil, a choice at a place), a coal carried a long way through country that has not been walked with a light for nine winters,
## and a thing left standing for the pick. Offered by an existing giver once their earlier task is handed in. House style (docs/LORE.md).
## Listed by quest_chains.gd under `# --- the regions' long tasks ---`. No class_name.

const ORDER := ["lanternwood_debt", "cairn_count", "oak_memory", "brine_road", "arches_keeper"]

