					{"at": Vector2(-317.0, 38.0), "text": "A blaze on an oak, a cap carved under it, and a number. Forty paces. The cutters counted their way out of the wood in paces, like men leaving a house in the dark."},
					{"at": Vector2(-312.0, 64.0), "text": "The Last Milestone's shadow, though the sun has not touched it in nine winters. A pebble set on its head for every cutter who passed. There are eleven."},
					{"at": Vector2(-320.0, 90.0), "text": "The lane ends in a ring of lantern-stones, each hollowed for a coal. Only one still holds a cold light, a shrunken cap, glowing the colour of milk. It has been left for whoever walks the lane last."},
