				"relight": "Take another cap-lamp from the last stone.",
				"arrive": "You set the cap-lamp on the punt's gunwale and it goes on shining, unhurt. The reeds round the landing turn very slightly toward it, like people.",
				"text": "Carry the cap-lamp the whole way to Ebba's landing at Reedholm. Walk it: a run, a roll, a blow or deep water puts it out"},
